 "description": "This stunning two-bedroom, two-bathroom penthouse apartment offers an exceptional standard of contemporary living, designed with both comfort and style in mind. The spacious open-plan layout seamlessly integrates the kitchen, dining, and living areas, creating a bright and inviting atmosphere ideal for entertaining and relaxing. \n\nThe sleek kitchen is a highlight, boasting a substantial island with integrated appliances, elegant wood flooring, and expansive windows that flood the space with natural light. Both bedrooms are generously sized, featuring plush carpeting, built-in storage solutions, and modern lighting fixtures to ensure a cosy yet sophisticated ambience. \n\nThe principal bedroom benefits from a luxurious en-suite bathroom, while the second bathroom is equally well-appointed with marble tiles, illuminated mirrors, and walk-in showers with contemporary black fixtures.\n\nAdditional features elevate this apartment to the next level of urban living. Step outside onto your spacious private rooftop terrace, where modern decking, glass balustrades, and outdoor seating areas provide the perfect setting for relaxation or entertaining against the backdrop of panoramic city or river views. \n\nThe apartment is equipped with ample built-in storage and a practical utility area with washer-dryer facilities, ensuring every-day convenience. The building itself showcases striking modern architecture, complete with secure underground parking and well-lit communal areas that enhance safety and accessibility. Every detail, from the sophisticated entryway to the contemporary pendant lighting and neutral décor, reflects a commitment to quality and comfort. \n\nEnjoy the benefits of a riverside location with urban amenities at your doorstep, making this penthouse apartment an outstanding choice for those seeking a property that is truly a cut above the rest!\n\nEPC Rating: C",
